# OutcomeOrchestrator managed sub-outcome worktrees (durable but never committed; R15)
.saga-worktrees/
# Local Saga runtime state (#695) — machine-local, never committed. Holds the engine-offer
# preferences and routing overlay (operator-specific), the mid-run adjustment envelope +
# reversible-mutation undo ledger (#372), gate records, workflow-lease-*.json receipts,
# workflow-evidence-*/ directories, lease-keeper/renew-loop logs, per-issue invocation-id
# pointers, and per-run .env files. The five previously-named paths under-ignored the
# directory — the blanket entry closes the gap so a blanket `git add -A` can never sweep
# runtime artifacts into a commit.
.saga/

# Mutation-canary run log (#427) — appended each run, inspectable locally / uploaded as a CI
# workflow artifact; never committed so a canary run never dirties the working tree.
docs/engineering-journal/canary-log.jsonl

# Local tool state & generated artifacts — regenerated from source each run, never committed
.neuralmind/
graphify-out/
.mcp.json
.serena
